  </prefigure>
</image>
        </paragraphs>
    </page>
    
    <page>
        <example workspace="2in">
            <statement>
                <p>
                    Let <m>f(x) = 2 - \sqrt{x+5}</m> and <m>g(x) = x^2 + x - 2</m>. The graphs of <m>f(x)</m> and <m>g(x)</m> are below. What do the graphs of <m>f+g</m> and <m>f-g</m> look like?
                </p>
                <sidebyside>
                    <image width="60%">
